# Innocent Blood in a game of three. Bot2 controls Bot3's Tamiyo, Collector of Tales (Harmless Offering), so Bot1's spell
# can't make Bot2 sacrifice its Memnite (CR 101.2). Bot3 is asked which Memnite to sacrifice and concedes: Tamiyo leaves
# with Bot3 then (CR 800.4a), after Bot2's sacrifice was already decided, so Bot2 keeps its Memnite.
[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Innocent Blood
Island x30
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x30
[Bot3 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Tamiyo, Collector of Tales
Harmless Offering
Memnite
Memnite
Island x30
